        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;This part is no longer needed. Please retrieve it from the refurb tech and return it to its appropriate shelf. IF this part was ordered from the supplier, please cancel the PO and/or return and delete the Pricing Request.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Part Request Number: &lt;/strong&gt;{!$Record.Name}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Asset: &lt;/strong&gt;{!$Record.Asset_Assigned__r.Name}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Refurb Tech:&lt;/strong&gt; {!$Record.Refurb_Test__r.Mechanical_Technician__c}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Asset:&lt;/strong&gt; {!$Record.Refurb_Test__r.Refurb_Asset__r.Name}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;System Location/SubLocation: &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(68, 68, 68); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Refurb_Test__r.Refurb_Asset__r.Location__c} / &lt;/span&gt;{!$Record.Refurb_Test__r.Refurb_Asset__r.Sub_Location__c}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pricing Request:  &lt;/strong&gt;{!GetPricingRequest.Name}&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Thanks,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Refurb Team&lt;/p&gt;</text>
